This code creates a full-screen canvas that resizes on window resize. It generates 200 particles with positions and velocities, using a softening parameter to avoid division by zero in gravity calculations. The simulation uses an orthographic camera to maintain a fixed view. Each iteration calculates gravitational forces between particles and updates their positions. A simple HUD shows the number of particles and a note about the simulation. Errors are caught and displayed to prevent crashes. The dark theme enhances visibility of the particles.
